# Supply Chain Analysis using Python 🚚📊

A guide to exploring and visualizing supply chain data using Python and Plotly.

---

## 📁 Dataset

- Example dataset: `supply_chain_data.csv`  
- Features include:
  - Product type, SKU, Price, Availability  
  - Number of products sold, Revenue generated  
  - Customer demographics, Stock levels, Lead times  
  - Order quantities, Shipping times, Shipping carriers/costs  
  - Production volumes, Manufacturing lead time & costs  
  - Inspection results, Defect rates, Transportation modes, Routes, Costs
